    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the penal law, the criminal procedure law, the general\nbusiness law, the state technology law and the executive law, in relation to\noffenses involving theft of identity; and to repeal certain provisions of the\ncriminal procedure law and the penal law relating thereto",
    "basePrintNo": "S5146",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5146-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
      {
       "alternate": false,
       "chamber": "SENATE",
       "districtCode": 34,
       "fullName": "Alessandra Biaggi",
       "imgName": "1051_Alessandra_Biaggi.jpg",
       "incumbent": false,
